================================================================================
Embedded coordinate reference system (CRS) registry
================================================================================
This crate embeds a CRS registry: coordinate reference system definitions
rendered as PROJJSON and WKT, used by Geosetta for CRS identification and format
translation. These definitions are DERIVED — programmatically re-encoded at build
time from the PROJ database (proj.db) — and are NOT the official datasets of the
organizations named below, nor are they authoritative. Each source's terms are
honored below and continue to apply to anyone who redistributes this data.

Dataset versions (stamped at generation from proj.db metadata):
    EPSG      v12.029          (2025-10-02)
    ESRI      ArcGIS Pro 3.6   (2025-12-01)
    IGNF      3.1.0            (2019-05-24)
    NKG       1.0.w            (2025-02-13)
    PROJ      9.8.1  /  proj-data 1.24
    IAU_2015  (planetary/lunar CRSes)

